  <item>
    <title>Gouging Fire is a Fire/Dragon-type Paradox Pokémon</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6655a2ab6d82f000580a32c2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6655a2ab6d82f000580a32c2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 May 2024 09:23:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Gouging Fire (ウガツホムラ, Ugatsuhomura</span><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Japanese" data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Japanese"><span>?</span></a><span>, trans. Ugatsuhomura) is a </span><a href="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Fire_type" data-url="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Fire_type"><span>Fire</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Dragon_type" data-url="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Dragon_type"><span>Dragon</span></a><span>-</span><a href="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Types" data-url="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Types"><span>type</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Paradox_Pok%C3%A9mon" data-url="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Paradox_Pok%C3%A9mon"><span>Paradox</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Pok%C3%A9mon_(creature)" data-url="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Pok%C3%A9mon_(creature)"><span>Pokémon</span></a><span> introduced in </span><a href="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Generation_IX" data-url="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Generation_IX"><span>Generation IX</span></a><span>.</span></p><span></span><h3><span>Physiology</span></h3><span></span><p><span>Gouging Fire greatly resembles </span><a href="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Entei" data-url="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Entei"><span>Entei</span></a><span> except its large head crest resembled a frill of a triceratops dinosaur, notability a Styracosaurus. It still bears gray paws with brown pads, but its front paws have sharp red claws extended outward and three green stripes are on its right thigh. It's gray plate still covers its muzzle and resembles a handlebar mustache.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Instead of black cuff-like bands around all four legs, there is only two on the back legs while the front legs each have two black pads on them. A long, light gray cloud of smoke now forms the 'tail' of Gouging Fire. Gray plating is still visible on its back compared to its cream underbelly.</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltSE9uo4RPLMOOn5t-lxD3z2_zea.m4a" length="43397229" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk6OKRxj7lB_DGhAHZzmgnOJJSL_.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Fennekin is a Fire-type Pokémon introduced in Generation VI.</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6632190072a4239751125ac4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6632190072a4239751125ac4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 May 2024 10:27:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3><span>Physiology</span></h3><span></span><p><span>Fennekin is a small, fox-like Pokémon. It has yellow, orange and white fur. The fur on its long, pointy muzzle is white, while its body is mainly covered in bright yellow fur. It has fluffy tufts of vibrant, flame-orange fur protruding from its ears. Its eyes are round and bright orange with slit pupils. Its nose is round and black. It has a short, bushy yellow tail with an orange tip, similarly shaped to the tail of </span><a href="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Zorua" data-url="https://pokemon.fandom.com/wiki/Zorua"><span>Zorua</span></a><span>.</span></p>]]></description>
