  <item>
    <title>Whimsicott is a Grass/Fairy-type Pokémon</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660cd103ee3fabb80600551a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660cd103ee3fabb80600551a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 03:46:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>消失了一段时间，我终于回来了！今年春节期间带我爸爸自由行去了阿联酋-土耳其-埃及，一共33天（太累太辛苦了），横跨了亚洲，欧洲，非洲，从地图上看走了个三角形。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我回来之后很多朋友都对我这个漫长的旅游好好奇，其中发现大家问的最多的是埃及！问的人太多了，这一期播客结合我在埃及13天自由行的一些特别的经历与感悟，分享一些看懂埃及古文明的一些基础知识储备，以及一些超实用的埃及省钱攻略 。</span></p><span></span><p><span>更详细的埃及自由行旅行攻略，欢迎关注</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/61d725ca0000000010009980?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=61d725ca0000000010009980&amp;apptime=1711993193" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/61d725ca0000000010009980?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=61d725ca0000000010009980&amp;apptime=1711993193"><span>Summer的小红书</span></a><span>参考</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，我也给听友们带了一些埃及特色伴手礼🎁（古埃及图腾&amp;神话的意义以及为什么值得买在这一期节目中也有详细说明），欢迎添加小助理VX：herfriends01 加入听友群抽取这份人肉背回的来自古埃及的幸运❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>➡️评论区抽4位听友送埃及明星片；听友群抽1位听友送古埃及艾莎草纸</span><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>【本期节目高光内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a> 埃及神话特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> 狗血又毁三观的埃及神话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 推荐去埃及旅游前看的书/电影/纪录片完胜埃及当地中文导游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 古埃及的图腾符号代表了什么含义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1393">23:13</a> 埃及经典旅游路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a> 最反差的埃及旅游景点：壮观的洞穴教堂与它背后的垃圾城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1807">30:07</a> 最震撼的埃及旅游景点：“死人”与活人和谐相处的死人城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">36:35</a> 勇敢的人先享受世界，黑市换汇，怒省一半</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a> 汇率的BUG打开了我在埃及旅行的新世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2623">43:43</a> 埃及景点买票，E人天堂，buff叠满，最全面的省钱方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2897">48:17</a> 用国内经济连锁酒店的价格住埃及四星五星的酒店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3102">51:42</a> 埃及旅游大交通到小交通的省钱方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3242">54:02</a> 智斗地头蛇，340美金/人/晚 Vs 60美金/人/晚 破解巨大信息差的埃及邮轮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3731">62:11</a> 埃及旅游安全吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3881">64:41</a> 埃及旅游避坑指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4428">73:48</a> 遭遇不好的体验勇敢表达与投诉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4779">79:39</a> 埃及旅游什么值得买</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目中提到的相关埃及内容】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>埃及九柱神</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>风神把天神和地神分开壁画</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>欧西里斯和伊西丝及小荷鲁斯</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>伊西丝经典壁画</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."><span>荷鲁斯经典造型</span><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."><img src="https://cgff0d298h.feishu.cn/space/api/box/stream/download/asynccode/?code=NmIyOTQ4ZWU2NmM5MTg4NTUyMjA1OTBiZDg3YzI1NThfYlRPZzdHWFg2VWtJQUhpdDM1MnVxWXJId3ZBRjJnd0hfVG9rZW46Q0toWWIxYndnbzRQZlV4WVphN2M1UzhWbkprXzE3MTE5OTMxNDM6MTcxMTk5Njc0M19WNA"></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>埃及亡灵书相关壁画：称心脏重量审判</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿努比斯复活欧西里斯壁画</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><img src="http