    <guid isPermaLink="false">660be6decf0dd31bee8e62d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Apr 2024 11:07:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Aerodactyl is a pterosaur-like Pokémon. It has an arrowhead-shaped point at the tip of its tail, a cone-shaped spike on its back, purplish-gray skin, and a lower jaw full of sharp teeth.</span></p><span></span><p><span>When it Mega Evolves, it gains black stone spike-like protrusions on it body; five on each wing, five on its head, one one its back, and three on its tail. It also has smoother black protrusions; one on its forehead and three on its chest.</span></p>]]></description>
