  <item>
    <title>《Whiscash》It is extremely protective of its territory</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660aaa11820116c18ac6a3fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660aaa11820116c18ac6a3fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Apr 2024 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Whiscash is a Water/Ground-type Pokémon known for its unique appearance and abilities in the Pokémon world. It stands at 0.9 meters tall and weighs approximately 23.6 kilograms. Residing primarily in watery environments such as rivers, lakes, and swamps, Whiscash boasts a rounded, chubby body with long whisker-like extensions.Renowned for its seismic prowess, Whiscash is capable of causing earthquakes with its powerful movements, particularly notable due to its affinity for muddy and swampy terrain. Its distinctive call is rumored to have the potential to induce seismic activity.In battles, Whiscash demonstrates formidable defensive capabilities alongside its seismic attacks, making it a formidable opponent. Its tranquil demeanor belies its strength, making it a fascinating addition to any Pokémon trainer's team.</span></p>]]></description>
