    <title>Aromatisse is a Fairy-type Pokémon introduced in Generation VI. It is Slurpuff&apos;s counterpart.</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660b7054820116c18ac6bbbd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660b7054820116c18ac6bbbd</guid>
