    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Aromatisse is a bipedal birdlike Pokémon. It is covered in fluffy magenta and violet fur; a puffy cloak of pink downy fluff covers its torso, while its head and extremities are violet. It retains the gray medieval plague doctor mask-based face which it had as Spritzee. It has bright red eyes with long tufty black eyelashes sprouting from each. Aromatisse has two wavy fur-covered ears with yellow patterns atop its head. It has short violet paws with small yellow claws and two long purple legs protruding from beneath its cloak of pink fluff. On its back it has two large black tufts resembling a bow.</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn0xnZXqw8Bea_p62-jvAR_yy4lu.png"></figure>]]></description>
